            "processedContentHtml": "\n                  <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-4\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"book-open\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#C68A36]\"></i>\n                          Texto da História (Listen & Read)\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#C68A36] bg-[#FDF8F0] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#C68A36]/30\">Imersão Sonora Pura</span>\n                      </div>\n\n                      <div class=\"space-y-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n                        <p>Grazi is married to Tom.</p>\n                        <p>Tom is a 50-year-old business administrator from Cleveland, Ohio. He is the Chief Executive Officer of a multinational pharmaceutical company based in Brasília.</p>\n                        <p>Tom is a great guy. Very friendly and easygoing. But Tom is a workaholic. He works many hours a week and sometimes on weekends.</p>\n                        <p>Grazi and Tom have been married for 18 years. Yes, they both speak English and Portuguese.</p>\n                        <p>He travels a lot. He has to fly to USA and stay there for about a week every single month. He is a very important executive for the company with a lot of responsibilities.</p>\n                        <p>Tom loves his daughters and he tries to be the best father he can be. But he doesn't get to see them very often. He is always very busy.</p>\n                        <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] pt-1\">The question, my friend, is: what does Grazi think of that?</p>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"bookmark-check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#C68A36]\"></i>\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F]\">Key Takeaways da Apostila (Aula 01):</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <ul class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed\">\n                        <li><b>Três Informações Condensadas:</b> <i>'a 50-year-old business administrator from Cleveland'</i> condensa idade, cargo e procedência em uma só melodia.</li>\n                        <li><b>Present Perfect Vivo:</b> <i>'Grazi and Tom have been married for 18 years'</i> expressa tempo decorrido até o Agora.</li>\n                      </ul>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                ",
