            "description": "Entrada & Imersão Auditiva • Conheça Jeremy: 16 anos, morador de Des Moines WA, estudante na Mount Rainier High School e jogador do time JV de basquete.",
            "videoUrl": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/agoraeufalo-3463a.firebasestorage.app/o/courses%2Fmagic-stories-legacy%2FMS011%2FMS011_LR_1.mp4?alt=media",
            "audioUrl": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/agoraeufalo-3463a.firebasestorage.app/o/courses%2Fms-legacy%2FMS011%2Faudio_ms011_lr.mp3?alt=media",
