            "rawScript": "",
            "processedContentHtml": "\n                  <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-4\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"book-open\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#C68A36]\"></i>\n                          Texto da História (Listen & Read)\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#C68A36] bg-[#FDF8F0] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#C68A36]/30\">The Story for 10 Years</span>\n                      </div>\n\n                      <div class=\"space-y-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n                        <p>Now, let's imagine that this situation has been the same for 10 years.</p>\n                        <p>Jeremy has lived in Des Moines, WA for 10 years. He has lived in a nice house with his family for 10 years. His father Steve has been an entrepreneur for 10 years. His mother Anna has been a yoga instructor for 10 years. They all have lived in a house very close to the sea for 10 years.</p>\n                        <p>Jeremy has been a student for 10 years. He has been going to Mount Rainier High School for 2 years. He has been a sophomore for 1 year now. Jeremy has loved basketball for 10 years. Jeremy has been practicing in the JV basketball team for 1 year.</p>\n                        <p>He has liked going to the movies, biking, and playing the guitar for 10 years. His favorite thing in the world has been ice cream for 10 years. Jeremy has been a typical teenager for 3 years.</p>\n                        <p>He has been getting up at 6 AM for 10 years. School has started at 7:10 for 10 years. Jeremy has been staying at school until 5 for 1 year. He has been having basketball practice for 1 year. His sister has been picking him up for 1 year.</p>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                ",
